  "title": "EN 17235 Harmonised: a new chapter for permanent anchor device testing",
  "summary": "On 9 February 2026, EN 17235 – the European test standard for permanently installed anchor devices used in horizontal construction applications – was officially harmonised. An 18-month transition period now applies, after which, manufacturers across the UK and Europe will be required to test applicable products to EN 17235 in order to issue a Declaration […]",
